## Potato chips | https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Potato_chips 
 Basic potato chips are cooked and salted; additional varieties are manufactured using various seasonings, flavorings and ingredients including herbs, spices, cheeses, other natural flavors, artificial flavors, and additives. The global potato chip market generated total revenue of US$16.49 billion in 2005.
